- [ ] If not required, redact first five digits so only last four show.
- [ ] Use a true redaction tool or permanently flatten the image/PDF.
- [ ] Remove metadata and verify the SSN is not searchable in the file.
- [ ] Send via secure portal or encrypted file if full SSN is required.
- [ ] Delete unredacted copies.

