- Is full SSN required? If not, redact down to last 4 digits.
- Redaction method: used a true redaction tool or converted to an image and overwritten.
- Removed SSN from filename, subject line, and email body.
- Stripped metadata / flattened the PDF.
- Chosen a secure transmission method (portal, encrypted email, passworded file).
- Confirmed recipient’s identity and instructions.

