How to redact correctly (do this — not just visually cover it)
- Use a true redaction tool (removes the underlying text and metadata), not just a black box or white-out that leaves the text layer or metadata intact.
- Steps (common methods):
  - Adobe Acrobat Pro: Tools → Redact → Mark for Redaction (select the SSN) → Apply Redactions → Sanitize Document (removes hidden data). Save as a new file.
