- Confirm what the recipient actually needs — sometimes they accept only the last 4 or a photocopy with last 4 visible.
- Don’t include other PII on the same page unless required.
- Keep an unredacted original in a secure location (encrypted disk or locked file) if you need it for records.
- If you’re unsure, call the organization and ask their preferred secure method to receive an SSN.

